From ef790d08094b3e654318d6ffb7526d717ab1adc8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:56:02 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Plait Messages: attach sheet, scheduled send, selfie GIFs and
 stickers, the PlaitOS look

- AppTheme uses the plait-design shapes and type scale.
- The attach button opens a sheet of tonal tiles: Gallery, Camera, Files,
  Voice, Contact, Location (one-time position + OpenStreetMap link), Notes,
  GIFs, Stickers, Selfie GIF (ten frames encoded on-device).
- Scheduled send queues text and subjects, keeps the chosen SIM, rearms on
  boot; each conversation lists pending messages with retry or removal.
- Conversation rows grouped by position; the title shows the version and the
  gear opens Settings. Tests for the attach sheet text and the plait code.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
